---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Simple-Multi-Agent Chat" description="Simple-Multi-Agent Chat — Free browser tool for three-way conversations with two independent AI agents">
  <style>
    .breadcrumb { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .breadcrumb a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }

    .plugin-hero { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .plugin-hero-icon { font-size: 3.5rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .version { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

    /* screenshot */
    .screenshot-wrap {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      background: var(--bg2);
    }
    .screenshot-wrap img {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }
    .screenshot-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16/9;
      background: #0d0f14;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      color: #3a4a5a;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .screenshot-placeholder .mock-ui {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 48px 1fr;
      width: 80%;
      height: 140px;
      gap: 0;
      border: 1px solid #1e2130;
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .mock-panel {
      background: #0d0f14;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .mock-header {
      height: 28px;
      background: #13151c;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1e2130;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 10px;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .mock-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .mock-label { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
    .mock-messages { flex: 1; padding: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
    .mock-msg {
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      border-left: 2px solid;
    }
    .mock-center {
      background: #0f1118;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border-left: 1px solid #1e2130;
      border-right: 1px solid #1e2130;
    }
    .mock-relay-btn {
      width: 36px;
      height: 20px;
      background: #13151c;
      border: 1px solid #2a2d3a;
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #4a5a6a;
    }

    /* download */
    .download-section {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }
    .download-section h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

    .dl-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-right: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .dl-secondary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .dl-note {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* how to use */
    .steps { margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .step {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .step-num {
      width: 28px; height: 28px;
      background: var(--bg2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .step-body { font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .step-body strong { color: var(--text); }

    /* features */
    .features-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .features-table th {
      text-align: left; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .features-table td {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.92rem;
    }
    .features-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    h2.section { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; }

    .api-note {
      background: #0f1a10;
      border: 1px solid #1a3a1a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #6a9a6a;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .api-note strong { color: #8aba8a; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .mock-ui { display: none; }
    }
  </style>

  <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/plugins">← Plugins</a></p>

  <div class="plugin-hero">
    <span class="plugin-hero-icon">🎙</span>
    <div>
      <h1>Simple-Multi-Agent Chat</h1>
      <p class="version">Version 1.0 — Free — MIT License</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>A single HTML file that lets you hold a three-way conversation with two independent AI agents powered by the Claude API. No installation, no server — just open in a browser, enter your API key, and start the meeting.</p>

  <!-- Screenshot / Mock UI -->
  <div class="screenshot-wrap">
    <img src="/multi-agent-chat-screenshot.png" alt="Simple-Multi-Agent Chat UI — three-way conversation with Orpheus and Erato" />
  </div>

  <!-- Download -->
  <div class="download-section">
    <h2>DOWNLOAD</h2>
    <div>
      <a href="https://github.com/achrag-works/multi-agent-chat/releases/latest/download/multi-agent-chat.html"
         class="dl-primary" target="_blank">
        ⬇ Download HTML
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/achrag-works/multi-agent-chat"
         class="dl-secondary" target="_blank">
        GitHub →
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="dl-note">
      Single file. No build step, no dependencies.<br>
      Download and open directly in Chrome, Edge, or Firefox.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="api-note">
    <strong>Anthropic API key required.</strong><br>
    This tool calls the Claude API directly from your browser. Your API key is stored only in memory and never transmitted anywhere other than api.anthropic.com.
    Billing is per-token at standard Anthropic API rates — a typical 30-message meeting costs a few cents.
  </div>

  <!-- How to use -->
  <h2 class="section">How to Use</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <strong>Get an API key</strong> from <a href="https://console.anthropic.com" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent)">console.anthropic.com</a> and add credits to your account.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <strong>Download the HTML file</strong> and open it in your browser. No installation needed.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <strong>Configure your agents</strong> — give each a name, role, color, and a system prompt that defines their personality and expertise.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">4</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <strong>Start the meeting.</strong> Use the bottom bar to broadcast to both agents simultaneously, or address each independently. Use the center relay buttons to forward one agent's reply to the other with a single click.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Features -->
  <h2 class="section">Features</h2>
  <table class="features-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Two independent agents</td><td>Each agent runs its own conversation context — genuinely separate thinking</td></tr>
      <tr><td>One-click relay</td><td>Forward Agent A's latest reply to Agent B (and vice versa) instantly</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Broadcast input</td><td>Send your message to both agents simultaneously from the bottom bar</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Fully customizable</td><td>Name, role, color, and system prompt per agent — set up any meeting scenario</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Copy button</td><td>One-click copy on every AI reply for easy reference</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Zero dependencies</td><td>Pure HTML + vanilla JS, no frameworks, no build step</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Model selection</td><td>Choose between Claude Haiku (fast/cheap), Sonnet (balanced), or Opus (powerful)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 class="section">License</h2>
  <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">MIT — Free to use, modify, and distribute.</p>
</Layout>
